# A two-variable WebKB-style collective link-classification model.
#
# Each web page has exactly one of the eight common semantic page types.
# Directed hyperlinks provide relational evidence through weighted class
# transition formulas.  Different class priors model the unequal frequencies
# learned from a corpus.

Student(X) | Faculty(X) | Staff(X) | Department(X) | Course(X) | Project(X) | Publication(X) | Other(X).
